# neovim.list — Neovim, and what its config assumes is installed
# (install/45-editors.sh clones the config and installs its plugins).
# The feature `neovim`.
neovim
efm-langserver          # linters and formatters
tree-sitter-cli         # `tree-sitter`: nvim-treesitter builds its parsers with it.
                        # (Void's plain tree-sitter package is only the library.)
